{"seq":12,"slug":"distributed-systems","title":"分布式系统","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"分布式系统\">分布式系统</h1><p>你打开一个网站、发送一条消息、完成一笔支付——在你看来，仿佛是在与&quot;一台计算机&quot;交互。但在背后，往往是成千上万台计算机，分布在世界各地的数据中心里，协同工作，共同完成你的请求。这就是分布式系统——现代几乎一切大规模互联网服务、云计算、大数据系统的根基。然而，把许多台计算机协调成一个整体，远比想象中困难——网络会延迟、机器会宕机、消息会丢失。分布式系统，正是一门关于&quot;如何让多台不可靠的计算机，协同提供可靠服务&quot;的学问。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望理解大规模系统底层原理的读者，无需深厚的分布式背景，系统讲解分布式系统从根本挑战到一致性、共识、容错的核心知识。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>分布式系统的基础</strong>阐明分布式系统的含义、采用它的动机（可扩展、可靠、性能、成本），以及它困难的根源（部分失败、网络不可靠、缺乏全局时钟、并发）。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>分布式系统的根本挑战</strong>细致剖析部分失败（难判断节点死活）、网络不可靠（消息延迟丢失乱序、网络分区）、没有全局时钟、并发等根本困难，理解分布式系统为何如此棘手。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>CAP 定理与一致性</strong>剖析数据复制带来的一致性问题、CAP 定理揭示的&quot;一致性、可用性、分区容忍&quot;三者不可兼得的深刻权衡，以及从强一致到最终一致的各种一致性模型。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>分布式共识</strong>考察分布式系统最核心的问题——多个节点如何在故障与不可靠网络下就某个值达成一致，共识为何困难，以及 Paxos、Raft 等经典算法的核心思想。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>复制、容错与意义</strong>剖析复制（可靠性的基石）的原理与一致性代价、容错的实现，并总结分布式系统作为现代计算基石的深远意义与贯穿其中的权衡智慧，为全篇作结。</p>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将理解分布式系统的根本挑战与核心机制，并对那些我们习以为常的大规模数字服务背后那个既强大又脆弱的真实世界，形成深刻的认识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"分布式系统的基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-distributed-systems","title":"什么是分布式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/foundations/what-is-distributed-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-distributed","title":"为什么需要分布式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/foundations/why-distributed"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sources-of-difficulty","title":"困难的根源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/foundations/sources-of-difficulty"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"fundamental-challenges","title":"分布式系统的根本挑战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/fundamental-challenges","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"partial-failure","title":"部分失败","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/fundamental-challenges/partial-failure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"unreliable-network","title":"网络不可靠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/fundamental-challenges/unreliable-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"no-global-clock-and-concurrency","title":"没有全局时钟与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/fundamental-challenges/no-global-clock-and-concurrency"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cap-and-consistency","title":"CAP 定理与一致性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/cap-and-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consistency-problem","title":"一致性问题的由来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/cap-and-consistency/consistency-problem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cap-theorem","title":"CAP 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/cap-and-consistency/cap-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/cap-and-consistency/consistency-models"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"consensus","title":"分布式共识","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/consensus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consensus-problem","title":"共识问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/consensus/consensus-problem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-consensus-is-hard","title":"共识为何困难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/consensus/why-consensus-is-hard"},{"seq":3,"slug":"paxos-and-raft","title":"Paxos 与 Raft","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-systems/consensus/paxos-and-raft"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"replication-and-significance","title":"复制、容错与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-book